<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:35:04 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>IHH Healthcare 首席执行官 Prem Kumar Nair 如何规划长寿的亚洲</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/ihh-healthcare-ceo-prem-kumar-nair-longevity-covid/</link><description>亚洲最大的私人健康集团的负责人正在推进临床寿命、癌症护理、人工智能和社区治疗。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Image-1.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 26 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/ihh-healthcare-ceo-prem-kumar-nair-longevity-covid/</guid></item><item><title>超过 100 万人点击了 LinkedIn 的“似乎人工智能失灵”按钮，该平台努力阻止“死亡互联网理论”成为现实</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/1-million-people-clicked-linkedin-ai-slop/</link><description>一项分析发现，LinkedIn 是“人工智能最饱和的平台”，其超过 40% 的长篇帖子被标记为完全由人工智能生成。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2279234883-e1787676180130.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:02:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/1-million-people-clicked-linkedin-ai-slop/</guid></item><item><title>解释说，草书不太可能在人工智能推动下卷土重来</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/cursive-state-mandates-ai-cheating/</link><description>现在有超过 25 个州要求使用草书。至少可以说，支持它的科学是不可靠的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290850729-e1787693826593.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 21:40:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/cursive-state-mandates-ai-cheating/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普政府提议对 H-1B 签证收取 103,000 美元的费用，国土安全部自己估计这将使 76% 的小企业陷入瘫痪</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/trump-h1b-visas-fee-startups/</link><description>H-1B 签证的额外收费是为了让公司雇用更多美国人，但沃顿商学院的一位经济学家表示，这可能会将就业机会推向海外。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2235796238-e1787677940507.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 17:42:08 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/trump-h1b-visas-fee-startups/</guid></item><item><title>Medicare GLP-1 折扣来了，为什么有些病人被排除在外？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/the-medicare-glp-1-discount-is-here-so-why-are-some-sick-people-excluded/</link><description>“我肥胖，病态肥胖，BMI 42。我做过四次心脏搭桥手术。我有中风的风险。我是糖尿病前期。但我却无法得到它。我很生气。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GLP-1_La_Marca_01-e1787692909576.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 21:25:57 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/the-medicare-glp-1-discount-is-here-so-why-are-some-sick-people-excluded/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 的慈善事业灵感来自于她无法读写的父亲：“我看到了这会带来多么严重的后果”</title><link>https://fortune.com/article/dolly-parton-philanthropy-inspiration-father-reading-writing/</link><description>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 用她 4.5 亿美元的净资产来做善事。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/GettyImages-2206129334-e1772215516472.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 18:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/article/dolly-parton-philanthropy-inspiration-father-reading-writing/</guid></item><item><title>每个政客都说他们是为工人阶级服务的，那么为什么只有 1% 的民选官员来自工人阶级呢？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/working-class-representation-global-democracies/</link><description>研究人员追踪了 97 个民主国家，发现工人阶级候选人与白领竞争对手一样有资格并有可能获胜，但他们却没有被录用。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-142021226-e1787692286343.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 21:12:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/working-class-representation-global-democracies/</guid></item><item><title>创作者经济即将达到 5000 亿美元，但为什么他们的粉丝感觉像监狱一样？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/creator-economy-burnout-audience-entanglement/</link><description>纽约大学对 54 名顶级创作者的研究发现了一种心理损害，研究人员称之为“观众纠缠”。一位创作者说她“宁愿死”也不愿继续下去。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1563191369-e1787691026300.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:51:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/creator-economy-burnout-audience-entanglement/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普官员和分析人士就原因发生冲突，佛罗里达州失去了 45 万名 ACA 注册者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/why-did-florida-lose-450000-obamacare-aca-enrollees/</link><description>佛罗里达州通过雇主获得健康保险的劳动力比例为全国最低，为 40%。该州也是 65 岁以下个人未参保比例最高的州之一，也是平价医疗法案 (Affordable Care Act) 规定的健康保险补贴使用者数量和比例最高的州之一，也称为 […] &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1287249266-e1787690170584.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:37:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/why-did-florida-lose-450000-obamacare-aca-enrollees/</guid></item><item><title>教皇利奥十四世谈人工智能新的“统治形式”：它有成为“经济殖民主义”工具的风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/pope-leo-xiv-ai-domination-risks-economic-colonialism/</link><description>教皇在向天主教立法者发表讲话时表示，算法正在创造一种新的统治形式，并警告人工智能威胁到家庭。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2214560813-e1787685135478.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 20:08:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/25/pope-leo-xiv-ai-domination-risks-economic-colonialism/</guid></item></channel></rss>